"text":"So that's getting bigger.","speaker":"A"},{"start":122.44960593795781,"end":124.19960593795781,"text":"Okay, that's","speaker":"A"},{"start":129.64960593795786,"end":130.14960593795786,"text":"turning.","speaker":"A"},{"start":134.63960593795764,"end":138.33960593795769,"text":"I don't quite know how to move upwards.","speaker":"A"},{"start":145.83960593795769,"end":150.13960593795764,"text":"Okay, so moving sideways is just up.","speaker":"A"},{"start":151.78960593795773,"end":153.68960593795782,"text":"Perhaps this seems to be helping.","speaker":"A"},{"start":155.03960593795773,"end":158.78960593795773,"text":"If we do this, will that work?","speaker":"A"},{"start":160.2716059379577,"end":161.7716059379577,"text":"Yes. Oh, fab.","speaker":"A"},{"start":163.7716059379577,"end":164.37160593795784,"text":"Right.","speaker":"A"},{"start":170.32160593795788,"end":178.62160593795784,"text":"So that means that up one is what we need to do and then we need up one at the end and","speaker":"A"},{"start":182.1716059379578,"end":184.82160593795788,"text":"to go sideways we need one, two, three.","speaker":"A"},{"start":187.37560593795774,"end":187.8256059379578,"text":"Let's try this.","speaker":"A"},{"start":189.72560593795788,"end":190.37560593795774,"text":"Oh, fun.","speaker":"A"},{"start":193.3256059379578,"end":202.0756059379578,"text":"So the grey ones in the left-hand side of the screen seem to be like the ones that","speaker":"A"},{"start":203.0256059379576,"end":204.0256059379576,"text":"instuck to you.","speaker":"A"},{"start":219.53560593795783,"end":222.38560593795773,"text":"Okay, so I think we need to get smaller.","speaker":"A"},{"start":224.63560593795773,"end":225.58560593795778,"text":"That's fine.","speaker":"A"},{"start":225.63560593795773,"end":226.73560593795764,"text":"So that makes it smaller.","speaker":"A"},{"start":228.03560593795783,"end":230.28560593795783,"text":"And then, so","speaker":"A"},{"start":231.83560593795778,"end":233.9356059379577,"text":"when it gets smaller, it needs to go one,","speaker":"A"},{"start":234.03560593795783,"end":236.83560593795778,"text":"one to the left.","speaker":"A"},{"start":236.88560593795773,"end":238.63560593795773,"text":"So let's do to the left.","speaker":"A"},{"start":239.63560593795773,"end":242.73560593795764,"text":"And then we go four down.","speaker":"A"},{"start":244.75160593795772,"end":253.3016059379579,"text":"So if we look at how to go down and just copy that and see if that works.","speaker":"A"},{"start":265.45160593795777,"end":267.70160593795777,"text":"So it's already the size that we want.","speaker":"A"},{"start":268.20160593795777,"end":271.6516059379578,"text":"Well, we want it to be bigger but we can't make it bigger until it goes through the hole.","speaker":"A"},{"start":272.8476059379577,"end":274.29760593795777,"text":"um so","speaker":"A"},{"start":279.04760593795777,"end":282.54760593795777,"text":"I want to turn it once turning","speaker":"A"},{"start":287.9976059379578,"end":292.9976059379578,"text":"it once there we go you managed to get turned I'll","speaker":"A"},{"start":296.8976059379579,"end":299.54760593795777,"text":"turn it purple I think I can turn a purple at any point","speaker":"A"},{"start":300.8156059379578,"end":302.71560593795766,"text":"I don't think it matters when it goes purple.","speaker":"A"},{"start":304.0656059379578,"end":311.9156059379577,"text":"Then I want to move down three spaces and then make it bigger.","speaker":"A"},{"start":314.01560593795784,"end":315.36560593795775,"text":"Let's try that.","speaker":"A"},{"start":329.1996059379578,"end":330.24960593795777,"text":"But I need to move it.","speaker":"A"},{"start":342.99960593795777,"end":347.9496059379578,"text":"Let's see if I go through the checker spots.","speaker":"A"},{"start":350.5496059379577,"end":351.89960593795786,"text":"Nothing really happens.","speaker":"A"},{"start":358.3836059379578,"end":358.68360593795774,"text":"Yeah.","speaker":"A"},{"start":359.4836059379577,"end":359.9836059379577,"text":"Right.","speaker":"A"},{"start":360.43360593795774,"end":362.68360593795774,"text":"How do I get... I","speaker":"A"},{"start":364.0836059379578,"end":365.0836059379578,"text":"don't feel like I have enough...","speaker":"A"},{"start":365.40360593795776,"end":365.80360593795785,"text":"Nice.","speaker":"A"},{"start":372.55360593795785,"end":373.1036059379578,"text":"Oh,","speaker":"A"},{"start":373.15360593795776,"end":377.65360593795776,"text":"so if I move it along to the checkered things,","speaker":"A"},{"start":377.8536059379578,"end":380.8536059379578,"text":"it kind of resets itself there.","speaker":"A"},{"start":383.05360593795785,"end":383.5036059379577,"text":"Fab.","speaker":"A"},{"start":383.65360593795776,"end":388.8536059379578,"text":"So then I can take this all the way, I just need to move it one more time that way.","speaker":"A"},{"start":390.8536059379578,"end":391.80360593795785,"text":"And then...","speaker":"A"},{"start":393.42360593795775,"end":395.9736059379577,"text":"Now I need to move it to once","speaker":"A"},{"start":397.92360593795775,"end":402.67360593795775,"text":"backwards and then upwards two","speaker":"A"},{"start":405.27360593795765,"end":407.2236059379577,"text":"times to get the next checkered flag.","speaker":"A"},{"start":411.57360593795784,"end":415.82360593795784,"text":"Fab and then I think I need to aim for keep","speaker":"A"},{"start":417.77360593795765,"end":418.27360593795765,"text":"going up.","speaker":"A"},{"start":419.8876059379577,"end":420.68760593795787,"text":"That is not correct.","speaker":"A"},{"start":421.33760593795773,"end":423.7876059379578,"text":"Let's keep going.","speaker":"A"},{"start":425.58760593795773,"end":427.3876059379577,"text":"Up four, I think.","speaker":"A"},{"start":427.5376059379578,"end":430.58760593795773,"text":"Let's see where that takes us. Yep, that's our number.","speaker":"A"},{"start":431.43760593795787,"end":434.8876059379577,"text":"And then once over.","speaker":"A"},{"start":436.7376059379578,"end":440.58760593795773,"text":"And then I need to go.","speaker":"A"},{"start":450.54360593795786,"end":458.6936059379577,"text":"I need to go to the left three times and then down once and","speaker":"A"},{"start":460.04360593795786,"end":462.9436059379577,"text":"then left again and that should get me home and","speaker":"A"},{"start":464.5936059379578,"end":474.5936059379578,"text":"there we go and now who knows what is happening now don't know what these orange checky flag things are","speaker":"A"},{"start":478.63960593795787,"end":480.6896059379578,"text":"We want to go up and","speaker":"A"},{"start":484.3396059379577,"end":485.4896059379578,"text":"onto this flag.","speaker":"A"},{"start":487.13960593795787,"end":491.53960593795773,"text":"So up, up, along,","speaker":"A"},{"start":494.03960593795773,"end":501.9896059379578,"text":"along, along and then down one should get me to the next rest spot.","speaker":"A"},{"start":506.7996059379577,"end":507.3496059379577,"text":"That's reset.","speaker":"A"},{"start":510.8496059379577,"end":513.6996059379578,"text":"I think I want to go up.","speaker":"A"},{"start":520.3996059379579,"end":521.0996059379577,"text":"And up.","speaker":"A"},{"start":525.6996059379578,"end":526.6996059379578,"text":"That gets me over.","speaker":"A"},{"start":526.7496059379578,"end":529.6996059379578,"text":"I'm not quite sure what is going on with the other Jackie things,","speaker":"A"},{"start":529.7996059379577,"end":530.3996059379579,"text":"but...","speaker":"A"},{"start":532.3356059379578,"end":535.7856059379578,"text":"We've survived so far.","speaker":"A"},{"start":535.8856059379577,"end":544.0856059379578,"text":"I'm going to go down one and then across four","speaker":"A"},{"start":548.3356059379578,"end":555.8356059379578,"text":"times and then up once and that should get me up.","speaker":"A"},{"start":556.0356059379578,"end":556.5